            </field>
            <field>
              <name>DSS</name>
              <description>[4:0] Data Size Select.
Note:
Master mode: Values 0 - 2 are reserved and shall not be used. This will map to 4 bit mode. A value of 3h corresponds to 4-bit data (and so on).
Slave mode: DSS should be no less than 6 which means the minimum frame length is 7 bits.</description>
              <bitWidth>5</bitWidth>
              <bitOffset>0</bitOffset>
              <access>read-write</access>
