          <fields>
            <field>
              <name>TAILR</name>
              <description>[31:0] GPT Timer A Interval Load  Register

Writing this field loads the counter for Timer A. A read returns the current value of TAILR.</description>
              <bitWidth>32</bitWidth>
              <bitOffset>0</bitOffset>
