0x0 Reserved
0x1 One-Shot Timer mode
0x2 Periodic Timer mode
0x3 Capture mode
The Timer mode is based on the timer configuration defined by bits 2:0 in the CFG register</description>
              <bitWidth>2</bitWidth>
              <bitOffset>0</bitOffset>
              <access>read-write</access>
              <enumeratedValues>
                <enumeratedValue>
                  <name>CAPTURE</name>
