              <description>[0:0] 0: Output enable active. SCLK_LF output on IO pin that has PORT_ID (for example IOC:IOCFG0.PORT_ID) set to AON_CLK32K.
1: Output enable not active</description>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <bitOffset>0</bitOffset>
