0x00: .0V
...
0x20: 1/8 = .125V
0x40: 1/4 = .25V
0x80: 1/2 = .5V
...
0xA0: 1/2 + 1/8 = .625V
...
0xFF: Max</description>
              <bitWidth>8</bitWidth>
