0: Dual trims needed on this chip
1: Dual trims not needed on this chip</description>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <bitOffset>27</bitOffset>
              <access>read-only</access>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>RCOSC_MF_SINGLE_TRIM_METHOD</name>
              <description>[26:26] Defines trim method used:

0: Dual trim method
1: Single trim method</description>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <bitOffset>26</bitOffset>
              <access>read-only</access>
            </field>
