The procedure used to clear the wakeup flag decides level or edge sensitivity, see WUFLAGSCLR.PROG_WU0.</description>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <bitOffset>7</bitOffset>
              <access>read-write</access>
              <enumeratedValues>
                <enumeratedValue>
                  <name>LOW</name>
                  <value>1</value>
