0: TIMER2CLKCTL.SRC is different from TIMER2CLKSTAT.STAT.
1: TIMER2CLKCTL.SRC equals TIMER2CLKSTAT.STAT.

RDY connects to AUX_EVCTL:EVSTAT3.AUX_TIMER2_CLKSWITCH_RDY.</description>
