              <description>[1:1] Update acknowledgement.

0: AON_RTC has not acknowledged UPD_REQ.
1: AON_RTC has acknowledged UPD_REQ.</description>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <bitOffset>1</bitOffset>
              <access>read-only</access>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>UPD_REQ</name>
              <description>[0:0] Request AON_RTC to update AON_RTC:SUBSECINC.

0: Clear request to update.
1: Set request to update.

Only change UPD_REQ when it equals UPD_ACK. Clear UPD_REQ after UPD_ACK is 1.</description>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <bitOffset>0</bitOffset>
              <access>read-write</access>
